{"1411010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "方舟军团 Ark Legion", "steam_appid": 1411010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/1874c46a3c8ffea8818da3ca8aea2b39.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The steam civilization was destroyed by a huge disaster, and the surviving humans entered the former forbidden area with their broken machines. Manipulate a massive steam powered land ark, construct a mobile city, and explore this mysterious and dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ark Legion is a game that combines strategy RTS and survival building gameplay. If you have any questions, you can join QQ group 261293882 and we will do our best to answer them for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a huge ark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cabin functions inside the ark can be freely modified. Different devices can be placed in the same cabin. Establishing an efficient production line or creating a comfortable living cabin, everything depends on your planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/1a4b6580283b6fc3912c5c86b4b94eff.poster.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/1a4b6580283b6fc3912c5c86b4b94eff.webm?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/1a4b6580283b6fc3912c5c86b4b94eff.mp4?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the vast world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world map consists of over 30000 hexagonal grid plots. The different terrains, organisms, resources, objects, relics, and other contents in the plot constitute this rich and colorful world. Hunting creatures, gathering resources, exploring ruins, and picking up items can all make your ark stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c49882a4d2749d2998d1e8bfd65df0c6.poster.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c49882a4d2749d2998d1e8bfd65df0c6.webm?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c49882a4d2749d2998d1e8bfd65df0c6.mp4?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade between cities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangerous trade routes that shuttle between cities established by different factions can bring rich rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c70f743b0a0012f4f2563bc53daf805d.poster.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c70f743b0a0012f4f2563bc53daf805d.webm?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c70f743b0a0012f4f2563bc53daf805d.mp4?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Battle of Iron and Fire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves' plundering and trade alliances' counterattacks can both trigger battles. There were both artillery battles between the ark and intense hand to hand combat inside the cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/593a5d873e34b7b9b6838275178b57fd.poster.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/593a5d873e34b7b9b6838275178b57fd.webm?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/593a5d873e34b7b9b6838275178b57fd.mp4?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/1874c46a3c8ffea8818da3ca8aea2b39.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The steam civilization was destroyed by a huge disaster, and the surviving humans entered the former forbidden area with their broken machines. Manipulate a massive steam powered land ark, construct a mobile city, and explore this mysterious and dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ark Legion is a game that combines strategy RTS and survival building gameplay. If you have any questions, you can join QQ group 261293882 and we will do our best to answer them for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a huge ark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cabin functions inside the ark can be freely modified. Different devices can be placed in the same cabin. Establishing an efficient production line or creating a comfortable living cabin, everything depends on your planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/1a4b6580283b6fc3912c5c86b4b94eff.poster.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/1a4b6580283b6fc3912c5c86b4b94eff.webm?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/1a4b6580283b6fc3912c5c86b4b94eff.mp4?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the vast world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world map consists of over 30000 hexagonal grid plots. The different terrains, organisms, resources, objects, relics, and other contents in the plot constitute this rich and colorful world. Hunting creatures, gathering resources, exploring ruins, and picking up items can all make your ark stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c49882a4d2749d2998d1e8bfd65df0c6.poster.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c49882a4d2749d2998d1e8bfd65df0c6.webm?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c49882a4d2749d2998d1e8bfd65df0c6.mp4?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade between cities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangerous trade routes that shuttle between cities established by different factions can bring rich rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c70f743b0a0012f4f2563bc53daf805d.poster.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c70f743b0a0012f4f2563bc53daf805d.webm?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/c70f743b0a0012f4f2563bc53daf805d.mp4?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Battle of Iron and Fire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves' plundering and trade alliances' counterattacks can both trigger battles. There were both artillery battles between the ark and intense hand to hand combat inside the cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/593a5d873e34b7b9b6838275178b57fd.poster.avif?t=1772170677\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/593a5d873e34b7b9b6838275178b57fd.webm?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/extras/593a5d873e34b7b9b6838275178b57fd.mp4?t=1772170677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A 2D adventure game that integrates gameplay such as exploration, trade, construction, and strategic battles. Drive a massive ark to explore the open world, equip your ark with different cabins and accessories, and build your own mobile fortress.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411010/header.jpg?t=1772170677", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/141101